{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LEARNMOOR: Kids Academy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LEARNMOOR: Kids Academy brings <strong>four fun and educational games</strong> for preschool to 1st grade! Your child can play exciting mini-games, practice key skills, unlock secret characters, and learn while having a blast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMO AVAILABLE!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only left clicks are needed\u2014simple, intuitive, and perfect for young learners!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAGIC MATCH</strong> \u2013 Explore colors and shapes with a magical wizard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LEAP INTO LEARNING</strong> \u2013 Help a little frog learn the alphabet, phonics, and sight words in a fun adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MATH-CASTERS</strong> \u2013 Practice numbers,  addition and subtraction while rising through the ranks of the League of Math!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REVIEW AND RUN</strong> - Test your accumulated knowledge of each difficulty while running away from imminent danger!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Practice Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game includes practice pages to reinforce learning:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic Match:</strong> Learn colors and shapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leap Into Learning:</strong> Master letters, numbers, and sight words.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Math-Casters:</strong> Addition and subtraction with a built-in calculator.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Review and Run does not have a practice mode since it takes the subjects from all the other games!</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlockable Characters &amp; Rewards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat challenges, reach new levels, and unlock fun characters in each game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Original Music</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>12 original tracks</strong> composed with <strong>Sentient Pulse</strong>, playable in the music menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun and Learning Combined!</strong><br>LEARNMOOR: Kids Academy makes early education exciting, engaging, and magical. Perfect for kids and stress-free for parents!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to fun learning!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3990520/4f0a9a879eb3d4e94f04bc14fe4c431e7dcc458d.jpg"},{"name":"Magic Match - Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3990520/5994835f428eb4bd7f43564c98df87e064b5c315.jpg"},{"name":"Magic Match - Mastered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3990520/3e981ac8b7e8b31a303c3892378b13610cae0a02.jpg"},{"name":"Leap Into Learning - Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3990520/c3186d6d7826925fe5247b9527fdb35abd34440c.jpg"},{"name":"Leap Into Learning - Mastered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3990520/302b4749b1f9b58ee533a04c51f03f82cac19548.jpg"},{"name":"Math-Casters - Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3990520/0bf33f74cb6fde38e4e0e12e14f02d567ff3208a.jpg"},{"name":"Math-Casters - Mastered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3990520/6f44e42c1eb273b3d14d90a25ce76b54ad09aa94.jpg"},{"name":"Review and Run - Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3990520/d221013b429730082253ff5e096457e397c7b931.jpg"},{"name":"Review and Run - Mastered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3990520/4c7cafa15660ffe18e700df95feda12db87b8b81.jpg"},{"name":"LEARNMOOR: MASTERED!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommun